hya and the others. I can rest a little easier knowing the village is still protected while I'm gone.","nextNodeIds":[715360104]},{"nodeId":715360104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3780991418,"text":"Take this time to get some good rest.","nextNodeIds":[715360105]},{"nodeId":715360105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30682,"speakerName":"Candace","textMapHash":2230928402,"text":"I will. Dehya wants to visit Qiaoying Village in a few days.","nextNodeIds":[715360106]},{"nodeId":715360106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30682,"speakerName":"Candace","textMapHash":2518034202,"text":"She said the scenery is beautiful, and the village is known for their tea. It's a perfect gift for the people back home.","nextNodeIds":[715360107]},{"nodeId":715360107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30682,"speakerName":"Candace","textMapHash":1430807322,"text":"I was planning to follow the tradition here and make a few gift envelopes for them.","nextNodeIds":[715360108]},{"nodeId":715360108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30682,"speakerName":"Candace","textMapHash":3997921026,"text":"But, Dehya packed our schedule to the brim, and with all the running around, I'm not sure I'll have the time...","nextNodeIds":[715360109]},{"nodeId":715360109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30682,"speakerName":"Candace","textMapHash":3562797906,"text":"Dehya told me you're good at making gift envelopes. Could you show me how to make one?","nextNodeIds":[715360110]},{"nodeId":715360110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4144938306,"text":"Of course, just leave it to me.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7153601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLB